%% ==========================================================================
%% Diagram 2: RFP Agent — Skill Pipeline Sequence
%% End-to-end RFP/RFI processing workflow from document upload to delivery
%% ==========================================================================
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Sales Professional
    participant UI as Open WebUI /<br/>Hermes Dashboard
    participant Curator as Skill Curator<br/>(Intent Router)
    participant Intake as rh-rfp-intake<br/>(Phase 1)
    participant Analysis as rh-rfp-analysis<br/>(Phase 2)
    participant Strategy as rh-rfp-strategy<br/>(Phase 3)
    participant Drafting as rh-rfp-drafting<br/>(Phase 4)
    participant Accuracy as rh-accuracy-review<br/>(Phase 5a)
    participant Review as rh-rfp-review<br/>(Phase 5b)
    participant RAG as rh-knowledge-retrieval<br/>(OGX + Milvus)
    participant Naming as rh-product-naming
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Pro
    participant Export as Export Engine<br/>(pandoc / xhtml2pdf)

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 1 — INTAKE

    User->>UI: Upload RFP documents<br/>(PDF, DOCX, XLSX, paste, URL)
    UI->>Curator: User message + document text
    Curator->>Intake: Route: "respond to RFP" detected

    Intake->>Intake: Scan /sandbox/data for files<br/>Convert DOCX/PDF/XLSX to text
    Intake->>LLM: Classify each document<br/>(Procurement Shell, Technical Scope,<br/>Pricing Template, Compliance, Legal)
    LLM-->>Intake: Classification results
    Intake->>Intake: Extract deadlines and timeline<br/>Determine RFI vs RFP vs Hybrid
    Intake-->>User: Intake Summary<br/>(customer, deadline, doc types, scope)

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 2 — ANALYSIS

    User->>Curator: "Proceed to analysis"
    Curator->>Analysis: Route: analysis confirmed

    Analysis->>LLM: Extract requirements from all docs
    LLM-->>Analysis: Structured tables

    alt RFI / Questionnaire
        Analysis->>Analysis: Extract questionnaire rows<br/>(ID, Question, Response Type)
    else RFP / Proposal
        Analysis->>Analysis: Extract deliverables, milestones,<br/>compliance Qs, staffing, KPIs,<br/>pricing structure, governance
    end

    Analysis-->>User: Analysis Summary<br/>(N deliverables, N milestones,<br/>N compliance Qs, constraints)

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 3 — STRATEGY

    User->>Curator: "Proceed to strategy"
    Curator->>Strategy: Route: strategy confirmed

    loop For each requirement
        Strategy->>RAG: Search for matching capability
        RAG->>RAG: POST /v1/vector-io/query<br/>to OGX Server
        RAG-->>Strategy: Retrieved passages + document_id
        Strategy->>Naming: Verify product names in results
        Naming-->>Strategy: Canonical names confirmed
    end

    Strategy->>LLM: Build coverage matrix<br/>(STRONG / PARTIAL / GAP / HUMAN)
    LLM-->>Strategy: Coverage matrix + strategy

    Strategy-->>User: Response Strategy<br/>(coverage %, auto-gen sections,<br/>human-input sections)

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 4 — DRAFTING

    User->>Curator: "Proceed to drafting"
    Curator->>Drafting: Route: drafting confirmed

    alt RFI Mode
        loop For each questionnaire row
            Drafting->>RAG: Retrieve answer evidence
            RAG-->>Drafting: Passages + citations
            Drafting->>Naming: Check product names
            Naming-->>Drafting: Corrected names
            Drafting->>LLM: Generate answer<br/>(Yes/Partial/No/HUMAN + citation)
            LLM-->>Drafting: Matrix row filled
        end
        Drafting-->>User: Filled RFI Matrix<br/>(with [GROUNDED] citations)
    else RFP Mode
        loop For each response section
            Drafting->>RAG: Search for section content
            RAG-->>Drafting: Knowledge base passages
            Drafting->>Naming: Validate all product refs
            Naming-->>Drafting: Corrected names
            Drafting->>LLM: Generate section<br/>(Services or Technology template)
            LLM-->>Drafting: Section draft with<br/>[AUTO] / [SCAFFOLD] / [HUMAN] tags
            Drafting-->>User: Section for review
        end
    end

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 5a — ACCURACY REVIEW

    Drafting->>Accuracy: Full draft ready

    loop For each factual claim
        Accuracy->>RAG: Retrieve source for claim
        RAG-->>Accuracy: Passage + document_id
        Accuracy->>Naming: Check all product names
        Naming-->>Accuracy: Naming issues found
        Accuracy->>LLM: Verdict: ACCURATE / INACCURATE /<br/>NEEDS NUANCE / UNVERIFIABLE / OUTDATED
        LLM-->>Accuracy: Claim verdict
    end

    Accuracy-->>User: Accuracy Report<br/>(N claims, verdicts, corrections)

    Note over User,Export: PHASE 5b — FINAL REVIEW

    Accuracy->>Review: Accuracy review complete

    Review->>Review: Completeness check<br/>(all requirements addressed?)
    Review->>Review: Consistency check<br/>(staffing, timeline, deliverable refs)
    Review->>Review: Format compliance<br/>(required sections, page limits)
    Review->>Review: Tone and language<br/>(no marketing fluff)
    Review->>LLM: Generate readiness checklist
    LLM-->>Review: Checklist

    Review-->>User: Readiness Checklist<br/>(accuracy, completeness, quality,<br/>human-review items, delivery info)

    Note over User,Export: DELIVERY

    User->>Export: "Generate final document"

    alt DOCX requested
        Export->>Export: pandoc MD to DOCX
    else PDF requested
        Export->>Export: pypandoc to HTML<br/>then xhtml2pdf to PDF
    else HTML requested
        Export->>Export: pandoc MD to HTML
    end

    Export-->>User: Final document at<br/>/sandbox/output/
